{
  "headline": "Net Revenue fell 9.3% (Rs 1,75,98,118) across the focal evaluation period.",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We evaluated the overall Net Revenue decline of 9.3% (Rs 1,75,98,118) using difference-in-differences, placebo timing windows, and dose-response checks.",
      "tier_from": "headline"
    },
    {
      "text": "The primary localized movement was detected in the App channel for Laptops, which accounted for Rs 88,13,345, representing 50.1% of the total Net Revenue decline, based on a support sample size of 1,112.",
      "tier_from": "localization[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A second localized concentration occurred in App for Large Appliances, contributing Rs 67,12,718, or 38.1% of the total Net Revenue decline, across a support sample size of 1,553.",
      "tier_from": "localization[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decomposing the overall movement indicates that volume shortfall drove Rs 65,27,372, representing 103.9% of the decomposed variance, while price changes offered a positive offset of Rs 2,83,853, or -4.5% of that variance.",
      "tier_from": "decomposition"
    },
    {
      "text": "Difference-in-differences testing for the App Laptops segment survived verification, recording a treated movement of -12.0% against a 0.0% control baseline.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "However, the dose-response test for this segment was inconclusive, showing per-period magnitudes between 91,21,941 and 1,05,28,700 with a spread of 0.035.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rival hypothesis testing broader Laptops movement also survived difference-in-differences evaluation, with treated movement of -12.0% versus a control movement of -2.1%.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "This rival category test passed placebo timing checks with a diff-in-diff of -4.8 percentage points against a noise standard deviation of 3.9 percentage points across 9 placebo windows.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conversely, a broader App channel movement hypothesis was rejected due to magnitude mismatch, as the rival scope moved 4.9% compared to the segment's 12.0% drop.",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "To address the movement localized to App Laptops, recommended interventions center on paid_marketing_spend.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    },
    {
      "text": "Post-intervention recovery should be monitored after 14 days against a success baseline threshold of 2%.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    }
  ]
}
